.env
docs
# The migration is a one-shot tool; its code never ships in an image. Its manifest
# does, because the uv workspace does not resolve without every member's.
migration/*
!migration/pyproject.toml
web
*.md
!README.md

# Written at runtime by every service, bind-mounted from compose. Never built into an
# image and never committed. Anchored, or it also excludes `packages/logs/` — which the
# backend and the bot both install — and the build fails to resolve the workspace.
/logs/

# The collector's config, bind-mounted into a pinned upstream image. Nothing here is
# built, so it has no business in any build context.
/vector/
